Package: clustPear
Type: Package
Title: Cluster-Weighted Pearson Correlations with Subgroup-Aware Estimators
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: person("Package", "Maintainer", email = "maintainer@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates ordinary pooled, cluster-weighted, quantile-grid, and
    rank-averaged Pearson correlations from paired clustered observations.
    Reports independent-cluster sandwich standard errors and approximate
    confidence intervals, with fixed-cutpoint inference for quantile-grid and
    rank-averaged methods. Optional cluster-constant sampling weights are
    supported for point estimation and independent-cluster sandwich inference.
    Includes a compact clustered-data simulator.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: Rcpp (>= 1.0.0), stats, tibble
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
SystemRequirements: C++17
NeedsCompilation: yes
Config/testthat/edition: 3
